sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer
    participant Code as Express routes/controllers/validators
    participant OAS as backend/docs/openapi.yaml
    participant Swagger as Swagger UI
    participant Postman as Postman
    participant CI as Validation

    Dev->>Code: Change API behavior
    Dev->>OAS: Update matching contract
    Dev->>Swagger: View local API docs
    Swagger->>OAS: Load OpenAPI file
    Dev->>Postman: Manually import contract
    Postman->>OAS: Read OpenAPI file
    Dev->>CI: Run validation
    CI->>OAS: Validate syntax and contract structure
